# Survivor Shields™ (#008)

Signature emotional mechanic for Survivor X™ — one earned second chance per season.

## Core rules

- **One shield per player per season** — never purchasable
- **Auto-activate on pick loss** — no manual deploy button
- **No shield on no-pick elimination**
- Consume shield **before** `lives_remaining`
- Pick result: `shield_saved` when shield deploys

## Implementation

- DB: `045_survivor_shields.sql`
- Engine: `processSurvivorLoss()` → `syncLeague.resolveWeekPicks()`
- Events: `survivor.shield_activated`, `survivor.shield_depleted`
- UI: `SurvivorShieldBadge`, `SurvivorShieldActivation`
- Legacy: `lib/survivor/db/careerStats.ts` via EventEngine subscribers

## Platform

Publish via EventEngine only — subscribers handle LegacyCore™, LiveCore™, RewardCore™.

## Accessibility

Full animation ceremony + reduced-motion static panel. GPU transforms only.

Full spec: `docs/SURVIVOR_SHIELDS.md`
